Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.54,0:00:05.42,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION. IT HAS NO\NCONNECTION TO ANY REAL-LIFE EVENTS OR ORGS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.13,0:00:04.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eleanor-san swore she'd defeat{\i0}\N{\i1}EDVA with her own two hands.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:08.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,To make that happen,\N{\i1}she tried to battle EDVA alone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:14.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She hit it with the hyperbolt{\i0}\N{\i1}that she'd risked her life to create.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.43,0:00:18.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even EDVA, a being made entirely of data,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:21.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}couldn't keep itself together after{\i0}\N{\i1}that blow, and it was wiped out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:23.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eleanor-san won!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:58.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}EPISODE 8: SUMMER BREAK FOR THE FIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:04.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.63,0:02:07.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Akira!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.38,0:02:09.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Eleanor-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.30,0:02:11.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Akira?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:12.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:13.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And you, Eleanor-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:15.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.01,0:02:16.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.01,0:02:19.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You two just up and disappeared, and we...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.89,0:02:22.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What about EDVA?! You fought EDVA, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:25.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Right! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:29.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I defeated it! All on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:31.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What? You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.69,0:02:32.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You beat EDVA?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.86,0:02:35.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.03,0:02:38.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying!\NI blew it up with a hyperbolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A hyperbolt? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:44.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,She borrowed the power of\Nthe spirits, and it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:45.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.75,0:02:49.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Is it true? Did you really defeat EDVA?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:52.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's really true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:56.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Eleanor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:58.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.89,0:03:00.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, so what are spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:02.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I wanna know, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:03.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.39,0:03:04.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Aw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:07.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Eleanor-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:07.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Eleanor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.11,0:03:10.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.57,0:03:13.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Nee-chan, do you have any water?\N- Would you pipe down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.07,0:03:16.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Man, I still can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:20.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So what did EDVA's face look{\i0}\N{\i1}like in its last moments?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:21.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish I'd seen it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:24.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Alan, please be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:25.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.71,0:03:28.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'd like to find a calm place\Nwhere she can rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:33.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:36.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The hotel on that island\Nappears to be open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:43.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wow, what an awesome room!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.60,0:03:45.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Eleanor-san, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:46.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.27,0:03:49.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll go get some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:14.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's all over now, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:17.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I don't need to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:27.56,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They're all asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:30.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You earned it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:46.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Hey, Alan, you think\Nwe can use Japanese money here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.75,0:04:50.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just go try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.85,0:05:08.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:10.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Morning, Akira-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:11.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:12.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.06,0:05:13.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're late, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:16.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You must be tired.\NYou could've slept longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:19.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm fine now.\NWhat about you, Eleanor-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.61,0:05:22.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Don't take me so lightly!\NI'm back at 100%!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:39.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,EDVA's really gone from\Nthis world now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:44.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Humanity doesn't have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:46.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We managed to keep Earth safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:48.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:52.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Isn't that incredible?\NI mean, {\i1}we{\i0} did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:54.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}I {\i0}did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:58.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with saying we all\Ndid it together? Don't be petty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.78,0:06:03.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The world is starting to return to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.49,0:06:05.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The internet and phones\Nare coming back online.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:08.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, then we could make a call, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:09.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:10.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I gotta call home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:12.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I should call my dad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:14.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:18.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm great.\NAkira's just fine, too. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:22.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Dad? Yeah, I'm doing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:24.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're good?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:27.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I have no one to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:28.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:33.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,My mom died right after I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:37.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,After my dad died fighting EDVA,\NI ended up in an orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:40.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I left there, and now I live on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:45.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I see. I always thought you\Nwere some rich young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:49.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You paid for our room\Nhere, too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:52.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Do you know about Cyber Watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:55.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's an app that's\Non every smartphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:59.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I made it. Along with several others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:03.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Holy crap! I wanna be your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:04.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Aren't you already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:07.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:10.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll put Akira on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:12.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Alan's with me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:17.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm fine. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:19.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:29.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What're you guys crying for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:35.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That was a hell of a growl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:41.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I bought a bunch of stuff yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:45.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's not real ramen, exactly,\Nbut please, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:46.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:52.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This is super good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:54.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah! It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:59.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Only Yoko could get this flavor out\Nof stuff she just scraped together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:02.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,These are the most delicious\Nnoodles I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:04.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:09.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'd love to have some more of the\Nmiso ramen I had in Hokkaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:11.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? I didn't have any!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, you were kind of frozen at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.75,0:08:19.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yo, Akira! Is this "miso ramen"\Nstuff good, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:21.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah! It's incredibly good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:24.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't raise the bar too high...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:29.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Akira-kun, are you trying to win her over?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:31.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,O-Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:33.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:37.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We're all full, so I guess\Nwe can part ways now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:38.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:40.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:46.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What? EDVA's gone. Aren't you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:49.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:53.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I just... don't want to say\Ngoodbye to all of you yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:54.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:56.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yoko-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:00.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:05.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Can't we stay together\Njust a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.71,0:09:08.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?! I wanna go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.51,0:09:11.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We... can't, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:14.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I like it! I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:15.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:19.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:21.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't mind, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:23.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I mean... I'm not saying no...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:25.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Really?! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:28.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Thank you so much!\N- Sheesh. She's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.03,0:09:30.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.28,0:09:31.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:36.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There's something I want\Nus all to do together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:46.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! Sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.09,0:09:49.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wow, there's a ton of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.01,0:09:51.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They're so cute!\NOh, there's more over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:52.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.47,0:09:54.18,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- Oh, look! A lamb!\N- What?! Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:55.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I wondered what it was she wanted to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.18,0:09:55.47,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Over there, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:57.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I guess it was just sightseeing.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.47,0:09:57.60,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, yeah! How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.47,0:10:01.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay, say cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.27,0:10:04.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hmm, this is hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.48,0:10:05.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:08.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hold it like this, and you\Ncan snap it with one hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:11.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wow! I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:15.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Here we go. Say cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:22.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Lala-san, Eleanor-san,\Ncan't you smile more?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:25.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh? Easier said than done...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:30.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's it! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.05,0:10:37.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,As soon as you jump,\Nbend your knees as far as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:39.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Ready? Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.85,0:10:41.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,One, two, three...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:54.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:56.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wow, they look like\Nthey came from a store!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:01.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I bet a picture would look\Nbetter from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:03.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I agree. Let's go to the very edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.95,0:11:06.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You two acted like this\Nwas such a pain earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:08.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They're having fun now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:14.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It was always my dream to take pictures\Nwith friends in all kinds of places.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:16.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Did we make your dream come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:18.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wow, this place is pretty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:24.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, Akira-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:25.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:26.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:28.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Smile! Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:33.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yay! A shot with just the two of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.61,0:11:35.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.07,0:11:39.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's this, now? You two getting cozy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:41.74,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, give it a rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:44.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, could you send me that picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:47.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What? You don't even have a smartphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:51.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll help at the restaurant and buy one\Nas soon as we're back in Okinawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:52.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:56.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey! Better hurry up,\Nor it's gonna get dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.51,0:11:57.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:06.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They have lots of rooms here.\NWhy are we all sharing one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:09.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Go get your own room, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:10.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I like this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:14.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Looking at the pictures from today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:15.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Look at this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:20.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:24.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I wanna see, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:27.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, gross! Delete that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:31.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Nope. This one's a precious memory, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:34.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?! When did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.43,0:12:41.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:44.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, send all your pictures to me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:46.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.14,0:12:47.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,S-Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:51.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are we gonna go tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.15,0:12:55.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There's a hot spring nearby.\NI'd like to go with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:59.74,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's so fun about sitting\Nin hot water? I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.74,0:13:01.74,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Eleanor-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:06.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, fine! You want me to get in\Nthe water? I'll get in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:09.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Um, sorry, but I don't think I should...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:11.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:14.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, a hot spring would\Nmean... no clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:17.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Why do you assume it'll be a mixed bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:18.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, true...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:20.84,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We can wear swimsuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:23.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I didn't bring a swimsuit, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:26.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So we'll start our day\Nwith swimsuit shopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:28.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Did you say swimsuits?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.69,0:13:36.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Want me to pick one for ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.36,0:13:37.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:40.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Any swimsuit's fine as long as\Nit covers what it needs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.15,0:13:42.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Then can I pick out\Nswimsuits for everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:45.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I want to do it as a gift to all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:47.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sure, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:48.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:50.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Then I'll pick yours, Yoko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:51.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll pick my own from over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:58.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No! I'm picking one for you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.09,0:13:58.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:04.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,How cute! You look so cute, Eleanor-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.51,0:14:08.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, but could you let\Nme pick my own after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:12.56,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh? R-Really? But it's so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:16.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Ooh, nice! It looks great on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:22.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Um, actually, Yoko-chan...\Nthe back is a little too...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:23.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:26.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry! I'll pick another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:31.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?! L-Lala-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:32.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I picked this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What d'ya think?\NI've got perfect taste, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:37.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What "taste," you pervert?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.13,0:14:38.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I don't mind this, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:41.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No way! I'll pick another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:42.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:45.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Might be too plain...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:48.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,P-Plain is fine! I'll take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:51.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yoko-chan, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:58.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Ooh, cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:14:59.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:06.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Um, sorry... but I think\NI need a bigger size...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.99,0:15:09.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:14.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I don't have enough money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:15.29,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.71,0:15:18.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:22.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I-I couldn't! You already\Npaid for the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:25.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We're friends, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:30.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.\NI'll be sure to pay you back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:32.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.35,0:15:36.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No, I will! This was my idea, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:40.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're strange. I've never\Nknown anyone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:43.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm... strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:46.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But I don't dislike that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.49,0:15:48.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm glad, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:54.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wow, an open-air bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:57.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Woohoo! We've got it all to ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:16:00.04,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, you're clearly enjoying yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.63,0:16:02.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm first in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:04.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Just yesterday, you said you\Ndidn't want to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.47,0:16:08.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:11.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This is just regular water!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What? It's not hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:14.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A-Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.81,0:16:17.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:21.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,"Due to a failure in the hot\Nspring water supply system,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:23.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,hot spring water is currently\Nnot available," it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:26.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:28.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Nishina-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:32.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Gluon Engine, Ignition!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:36.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What are you doing, Yoko-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:38.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Stand back, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:39.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I forgot we had that option.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:58.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yoko's finally got full control\Nof her Engine's output now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:17:00.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's the perfect temperature!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.69,0:17:01.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:11.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes it a\Nnuclear fusion hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:21.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Bum ba-bum ba-bum bum bum...\NIs that how it goes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:24.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Feels great, doesn't it, Lalacchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes. All thanks to Yoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:31.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,She's been stringing us along a lot\Nsince yesterday, but it's been fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:34.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so glad they're having a good time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.06,0:17:37.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Akira-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:38.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:43.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I never even dreamed I'd end\Nup fighting to save Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:47.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Not until you fell from the sky\Nin front of me that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:50.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I ended up dragging you into it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.03,0:17:53.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Nah. The battle against EDVA was tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:57.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,but I met all of you,\Nthe first friends I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:18:02.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And it made me realize that\Neven I can be of use to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:05.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to you, Akira-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:07.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yoko-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:10.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey! You just called her Yoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:14.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Oh... I'm sorry!\NEveryone else calls you that, so I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:18.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's fine! You can call me Yoko!\NWe're friends, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:20.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:22.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, good for you, Akira.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.85,0:18:25.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Would you drop it already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:27.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out. A rocket just launched.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:31.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Proof that the world's back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:34.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, 'cause we defeated EDVA.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.20,0:18:36.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I {\i0}defeated EDVA!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:39.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, what're you guys gonna do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:43.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That kinda came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:48.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, I wanna tell the\Nprevious generation of VERTEX
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:53.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,what the kids they entrusted the\Nfuture to are gonna do from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:54.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You first, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:56.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.55,0:19:00.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll join the JSDF\Nor be a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:04.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's so like you, it's not even funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:06.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What about you, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:12.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, defeating EDVA was the only thing\NI ever thought about until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.11,0:19:15.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I guess being a park ranger could be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.99,0:19:18.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That sounds perfect for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:21.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It does, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.12,0:19:24.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I wanna do something that involves sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.75,0:19:28.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But before that, I want to go\Nto college in Tokyo if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:31.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What? That's news to me. Does Mom know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:34.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Not yet. I'm gonna tell\Nher when we get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:36.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You, Yoko-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:39.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:42.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I always kind of figured I'd\Ntake over my dad's ramen shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.64,0:19:47.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,but after meeting and\Nfighting alongside all of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:53.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I think I want to do something\Nto protect people, like Akira-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:56.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You totally could, Yoko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:19:59.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Damn it, she's grown up so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:01.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And what're you gonna do, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:04.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Me? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.79,0:20:07.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You want to be a clockmaker, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:13.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was supposed to go to school\Nto learn clockmaking this fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:18.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Then EDVA appeared, and I gave up.\NI thought it was no longer possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:22.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But thanks to all of you, EDVA is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.51,0:20:27.23,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Now I can go to school after all.\NI can be a clockmaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.73,0:20:30.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, because {\i1}I{\i0} beat EDVA!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:32.44,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. We get it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:37.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Eleanor, everyone... thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.49,0:20:41.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll buy one\Nof the clocks you make!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:42.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll give you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:44.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No! I'm gonna buy one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.95,0:20:46.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You really are strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.09,0:20:58.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess this is goodbye for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:21:01.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourselves,\NEleanor-san and Lala-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.22,0:21:04.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Come visit Hokkaido again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:08.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Looking forward to tasting\Nthis "miso ramen" you make!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.14,0:21:12.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.85,0:21:13.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:16.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:18.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're on our way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:21.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So much for a touching goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.41,0:21:22.74,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Come on, Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:31.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Mom? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:32.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The call died...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.21,0:21:34.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.63,0:21:38.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's... a Power Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:39.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.55,0:21:41.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.77,0:21:54.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I-It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:22:00.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It can't be! I took you out myself, EDVA!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:40.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}EPISODE 9: 40,320 KILOMETERS PER HOUR

